A '''dance club'''<ref name="SC2AD" /> that also operated as a [[cabaret]]<ref name="Melna DB">{{Databank|melna|Melna}}</ref> was located at [[Borgo Prime|Port Borgo]] during the [[New Republic Era]].<ref name="SC2">{{SkeletonCrew|Way, Way Out Past the Barrier}}</ref> The [[Theelin]] [[Melna]] worked at the establishment as a dancer.<ref name="Melna DB" /> A sign over the entrance, written in an [[Unidentified Aurebesh script (battle helmet)|alternative Aurebesh script]], said "DANCE CLUB".<ref name="SC2" />

